24508a5c713cd51bac3e47d83.poster.avif?t=1696785312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686800/extras/b71ffbf24508a5c713cd51bac3e47d83.webm?t=1696785312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686800/extras/b71ffbf24508a5c713cd51bac3e47d83.mp4?t=1696785312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A very valuable resource drops from destroyed enemies - spheres from which you can get additional weapons.<br><br>Every enemy possesses an individual behavior pattern<br>Enemies have blind zones and different alarm activation patterns.<br>The player can attack head on or sneak to the enemies' blind zones and calmly destroy them.<br>Some enemies are easier to battle in open spaces, with some it may be wiser to use cover.<br>Or you can just quickly defeat everybody in your way with smart use of items.<br><br>Your primary weapon is pretty powerful and is an effective tool to eliminate enemies. It is permanently at your disposal.<br>But there is a vast arsenal of tools, weapons and gadgets at your disposal, that will help destroying enemies faster, more effective, more spectacular and a lot more fun.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686800/extras/5fc33efb930f86f26a09e677f42aa043.poster.avif?t=1696785312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686800/extras/5fc33efb930f86f26a09e677f42aa043.webm?t=1696785312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686800/extras/5fc33efb930f86f26a09e677f42aa043.mp4?t=1696785312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
